      "item_body": "<p>[K/U] For each function, determine the critical points and classify them as local maxima or local minima, or neither. Sketch the graph of each function.</p>\n<p>a. f(x) = -2x^2 + 8x + 13; critical point: <span id=\"blank_8c8261b1-399d-4519-ac22-24100e65a7c0\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_21b5f4dc-34b6-462e-99db-0c371cf21284\"></span>)</p>\n<p>b. f(x) = (1/3)x^3 - 9x + 2; critical points: <span id=\"blank_83764de7-ad53-4e13-b0df-640876844be0\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_2cf91f05-b560-42ef-bf9f-1dab0d571796\"></span>), <span id=\"blank_401fa244-cab9-41be-b76a-501f611fb779\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_cb60692d-98fb-4d84-9a71-b9a3e99d10d5\"></span>)</p>\n<p>c. f(x) = 2x^3 + 9x^2 + 12x; critical points: <span id=\"blank_644bbda6-b190-42f4-aea4-ecea38d08734\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_48a4cb32-6433-484a-b902-c6e059b18ed1\"></span>), <span id=\"blank_7abec881-4d10-47f5-a350-84a6ce3437ad\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_14f9167e-f0eb-4756-9970-d672db43964c\"></span>)</p>\n<p>d. f(x) = -3x^3 - 5x; <span id=\"blank_431a3270-eb7f-4e6d-b5a0-83e0985f48ea\"></span></p>\n<p>e. f(x) = sqrt(x^2 - 2x + 2); critical point: <span id=\"blank_2b75d91a-996e-4959-9de4-ba6ddb379745\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_a0d1c6fe-812e-4e67-8b43-969dd9d85989\"></span>)</p>\n<p>f. f(x) = 3x^4 - 4x^3; critical points: <span id=\"blank_f35f1693-3187-45a7-ba60-ddda676bd41d\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_2d907850-2a96-4db5-80b2-2272914f0945\"></span>), <span id=\"blank_739ac3f4-cba8-4eb6-8276-41bbce0328e6\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_ae34cfd1-8900-4bcc-a98c-cfe24d97c8f5\"></span>)</p>",
