      "item_body": "<p>Determine the critical points of each function. Classify each critical point as a local maximum, a local minimum, or neither. Is the tangent to the graph at each point parallel to the x-axis?</p>\n<p>a. f(x) = -2x^3 + 9x^2 + 20; critical points: <span id=\"blank_29692fb5-580e-42c3-acbf-186c81325aea\"></span> (local <span id=\"blank_30b21529-7599-4c82-bea5-ecdd7fb9a8a5\"></span>, tangent <span id=\"blank_e3d895a4-ac2d-4389-a7c2-cdbfbd7abdcf\"></span>), <span id=\"blank_48c095fe-a5cd-4d0d-b5d7-bb24ceb3c061\"></span> (local <span id=\"blank_97720464-dd1e-4ff3-b5cb-795ba8af9552\"></span>, tangent <span id=\"blank_76391a4e-a236-4d63-bf4c-05b13aa38160\"></span>)</p>\n<p>b. f(x) = x^4 - 8x^3 + 18x^2 + 6; critical points: <span id=\"blank_678be18f-24ff-4b59-abc4-87ca07405a08\"></span> (local <span id=\"blank_07949ecb-f9e6-4d9a-a6ab-f0ecdbc6ac3c\"></span>, tangent <span id=\"blank_54e59853-3cb5-4a46-8b1b-5f5cd1fd94aa\"></span>), <span id=\"blank_9fa854d6-6b9a-4f70-bf26-873d618a1904\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_c314f7c0-afea-4392-8fda-6d047ad876af\"></span>, tangent <span id=\"blank_c83acf45-e6cc-4a33-a89a-71d0b5e007c1\"></span>)</p>\n<p>c. h(x) = (x - 3)/(x^2 + 7); critical points: <span id=\"blank_80820092-6a17-4ecd-9b18-8616027b9e8c\"></span> (local <span id=\"blank_1c99f16e-91cd-4838-8edd-65e8a19b00e7\"></span>, tangent <span id=\"blank_7d1344de-e8c5-4175-8e57-30fc2fcfa143\"></span>), <span id=\"blank_5c57f0f7-7e29-4d0b-820a-d76503feaa29\"></span> (local <span id=\"blank_47ef72c2-16d5-4e1e-9893-67a811c8b8c3\"></span>, tangent <span id=\"blank_0a7c2d5e-52cd-4e70-b5dc-99ea3602c38e\"></span>)</p>\n<p>d. g(x) = (x - 1)^(1/3); critical point: <span id=\"blank_a2572350-da2b-4889-bbc4-3daa1a9ad243\"></span> (<span id=\"blank_d92ce96c-d2b3-4674-849a-cd307414ee6a\"></span>, tangent <span id=\"blank_a471c680-dc7c-4012-8d19-f128f35788f7\"></span>)</p>",
